dts: qcs6490-rubikpi3 修正 USB QMP PHY 供电对调（backport 上游 83185fc5f51e 板级 hunk）

QMP PHY 的 vdda-phy 期望约 0.88V、vdda-pll 期望 1.2V；初版 DTS 把两路供电写反。
上游同一提交还修正了 rb3gen2 / minipc-g1iot，这里只取 RUBIK Pi 3 的 hunk：

  arm64: dts: qcom: qcs6490: Fix swapped USB QMP PHY vdda-phy/vdda-pll supplies
  Fixes: f055a39f6874 ("arm64: dts: qcom: Add qcs6490-rubikpi3 board dts")
  Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20260803-phy-supply-fix-v1-13-5880630cde3e@oss.qualcomm.com

基线升级到已含该提交的内核后删除本补丁。

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-thundercomm-rubikpi3.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-thundercomm-rubikpi3.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-thundercomm-rubikpi3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-thundercomm-rubikpi3.dts
@@ -1111,8 +1111,8 @@
 };
 
 &usb_1_qmpphy {
-	vdda-phy-supply = <&vreg_l6b_1p2>;
-	vdda-pll-supply = <&vreg_l1b_0p912>;
+	vdda-phy-supply = <&vreg_l1b_0p912>;
+	vdda-pll-supply = <&vreg_l6b_1p2>;
 
 	status = "okay";
 };
